BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261012-12@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261012T103222Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261012T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261012T210000
SUMMARY:Mimi Roman\, The Brooklyn Cowgirls
LOCATION:Lucinda's\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening with1950's Decca Recording Artist Mimi R
 
oman\, accompanied by The Brooklyn Cowgirls. The band starts the evening of
 
f with a set featuring songs by Mimi's contemporaries\, including Gene Autr
 
y\, Elvis Presley\, Patsy Cline\, The Everly Brothers. Mimi then joins the 
 
Cowgirls onstage to sing her hits. The live music will be preceded by a sho
 
rt documentary of Mimi's Stories and Memories and a curated exhibit of stag
 
e costumes\, instruments and photos as a visual anchor of her musical legac
 
y. Born Miriam Rothman in 1934 and raised in Brooklyn\, Mimi Roman fell for
 
 country music by catching late-night clear-channel radio broadcasts from D
 
el Rio and Nashville. A horse-riding prize at the Madison Square Garden rod
 
eo led to a singing spot beside Gene Autry\, an audition for Arthur Godfrey
 
's Talent Scouts\, and eventually a Decca Records contract cut in Nashville
 
 with session players like Chet Atkins and producer Owen Bradley. Billed as
 
 the Brooklyn Cowgirl\, she toured and recorded through the mid-1950s and e
 
arly '60s\; as Mimi Roman in country\, and as Kitty Ford on the pop side\; 
 
before stepping back from the industry to build a life closer to home. Deca
 
des later\, her recordings found a second life among rockabilly collectors\
 
, leading to the 2022 archival releases First of the Brooklyn Cowgirls and 
 
Pussycat on Sundazed Music. Monday October 12th\, 6:30-9pm at Lucinda's\, 1
 
69 Ave A\, NYC Limited Tickets available at lucindasnyc.com Visit mimiroman
 
.com for more information. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/
 
mimi-roman-the-brooklyn-cowgirls-lucindas-tickets/14305944
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/mimi-roman-the-brooklyn-cowgirls-lucind
 
as-tickets/14305944
END:VEVENT
