BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261012-14@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261012T103222Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261012T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261012T210000
SUMMARY:VIRTUAL HALSTON LIVE with Julie Halston and Jackie Hoffman
LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:VIRTUAL HALSTON LIVE RETURNS TO BIRDLAND FOR ONE NIGHT ONLY OCT
 
OBER 12 AT 7PMFeaturing Special Guest Jackie Hoffman New York\, NY The hit 
 
web series VIRTUAL HALSTON\, created during the global pandemic by Julie Ha
 
lston\, Jim Caruso\, and Ruby Locknar\, returns to the stage for a special 
 
one-night-only live presentation at Birdland on Monday\, October 12 at 7pm.
 
 Julie Halston brings her signature wit\, theatrical storytelling\, and bac
 
kstage brilliance to this special evening\, joined by celebrated actress\, 
 
singer and comedian Jackie Hoffman. The program will feature Halstons trade
 
mark stories along with an entertaining and insightful conversation between
 
 the longtime friends and collaborators. Ms. Halston says\, Jackie Hoffman 
 
is one of the funniest humans alive. Weve known each other forever\, worked
 
 together a number of times\, and love to dish\, judge\, and make each othe
 
r laugh. We have ALL the stories\, and I cant wait to sit down with her on 
 
the Birdland stage to discuss all things show biz and\, of course\, all ong
 
oing medical issues! Hoffman Julie Halston most recently appeared in the Br
 
oadway revival of Thornton Wilders Our Town. Her Broadway credits include T
 
ootsie\, Hairspray\, Gypsy\, and Anything Goes. In 2021\, she received the 
 
Isabelle Stevenson Tony Award for her advocacy on behalf of The Pulmonary F
 
ibrosis Foundation. Halston is widely known for her portrayal of Bitsy Von 
 
Muffling on Sex and the City and And Just Like That\, and her sold-out one-
 
woman performances at Birdland have earned her multiple comedy honors and a
 
 devoted following. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/virtual
 
-halston-live-with-julie-birdland-jazz-club-tickets/14278814
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/virtual-halston-live-with-julie-birdlan
 
d-jazz-club-tickets/14278814
END:VEVENT
