SUMMARY:The Bechdel Cast 10 Year Anniversary Tour
LOCATION:The Bell House\, Carroll Gardens-Cobble Hill-Gowanus-Red Hook
DESCRIPTION:It's been 10 years & we can still remember the fresh podcast. T
 
he recording equipment had never been used. The movies had never been watch
 
ed. The Bechdel Cast was called "The Show of Dreams"--& it really was! Join
 
 hosts Jamie Loftus & Caitlin Durante for a LIVE SHOW celebrating their 10 
 
YEAR ANNIVERSARY of hosting The Bechdel Cast! Caitlin & Jamie are taking a 
 
look at the past decade of (genius\, brilliant\, important) discussions abo
 
ut film & pondering how releasing radical mp3s every week didn't fix global
 
 misogyny?! Door Time: 6:30pm *(bar opens: 5:30pm). Show Time: 7:30pm. 21 &
 
 over w/ valid\, government-issued photo ID. General Admission standing & s
 
eating. *Seating is 1st come 1st served & not guaranteed. Arrive early for 
 
best selection. **If you have an accessibility request\, please email thebe
 
llhouse@livenation.com prior. No outside food/drink. $.25 per each ticket s
 
old for a majority of events @ The Bell House benefits Comedy Gives Back. T
 
ickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/the-bechdel-cast-10-year-annive
 
rsary-brooklyn-new-york-10-12-2026/event/3000650C0357B525
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/the-bechdel-cast-10-year-anniversary-brook
 
lyn-new-york-10-12-2026/event/3000650C0357B525
END:VEVENT
